## 5. Edge Cases
* **Concurrent Checkout:** Two users attempt to buy the last available unit at the exact same millisecond (handled via strict database transaction isolation and Redis locking).
* **Payment Gateway Timeout:** User's account is debited, but the gateway fails to ping the backend webhook (requires a background reconciliation job to verify pending payments).
* **Cart Abandonment Post-Lock:** User locks inventory but closes the tab. The system must release the lock exactly after the TTL (Time-To-Live) expires so the item is sellable again.
* **Invalid Delivery Pin Codes:** User enters a rural zip code not supported by the integrated courier (system must fallback to custom shipping quotes or block checkout).

## 6. Non-Goals (For V1)
* Building a multi-vendor marketplace (like Daraz); this is strictly a single-tenant store.
* Developing native iOS/Android applications (focus entirely on a robust web app/PWA first).
* Building a custom internal payment gateway (strictly use third-party aggregators).
* Complex loyalty point and reward systems.

## 7. Success Metrics
* **Performance:** Largest Contentful Paint (LCP) under 2.5 seconds on mobile 3G.
* **Reliability:** 99.9% uptime for core checkout flows; zero dropped database transactions during inventory locking.
* **Conversion:** Cart-to-Checkout completion rate > 30%.
* **Retention:** Session persistence success rate of 100% across browser re-opens within a 7-day window.